<title>USA: Harris Cty MUD 102, Texas, won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Harris Cty MUD 102, Texas, won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds Inc. said it won $1.475 million of Harris Cty MUD 102, Texas waterworks and sewer system combination tax and revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.43 percent.</p>
</text>
